    {
      "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-private-sector-act-2000-sch-1-sec-5b-ss-2",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "5B(2) Extra-territorial operation of Act",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/privacy-amendment-private-sector-act-2000#sch-1-sec-5b-ss-2"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "privacy-amendment-private-sector-act-2000.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "privacy-amendment-private-sector-act-2000.pdf, p.8",
      "values:originalText": "(2) The organisation must be:\n\n(a) an Australian citizen; or\n\nAmendment of the Privacy Act 1988  Schedule 1\n\n(b) a person whose continued presence in Australia is not subject\nto a limitation as to time imposed by law; or\n\n(c) a partnership formed in Australia or an external Territory; or\n\n(d) a trust created in Australia or an external Territory; or\n\n(e) a body corporate incorporated in Australia or an external\nTerritory; or\n\n(f) an unincorporated association that has its central\nmanagement and control in Australia or an external Territory.\nOther link with Australia",
      "skos:definition": "(2) The organisation must be:\n\n(a) an Australian citizen; or\n\nAmendment of the Privacy Act 1988  Schedule 1\n\n(b) a person whose continued presence in Australia is not subject\nto a limitation as to time imposed by law; or\n\n(c) a partnership formed in Australia or an external Territory; or\n\n(d) a trust created in Australia or an external Territory; or\n\n(e) a body corporate incorporated in Australia or an external\nTerritory; or\n\n(f) an unincorporated association that has its central\nmanagement and control in Australia or an external Territory.\nOther link with Australia",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-private-sector-act-2000-sch-1-sec-5b"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-private-sector-act-2000-sch-1-sec-5b-ss-2-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-private-sector-act-2000-sch-1-sec-5b-ss-2-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "b23ac2700cb8164de90960e6ff17a3d95391c78a630a42e58a08db319d622280",
      "skos:note": "Must be an Australian citizen or a person with certain presence in Australia"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/privacy-amendment-private-sector-act-2000#sch-1-sec-5b-ss-2",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "5B(2) Extra-territorial operation of Act",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 8,
      "values:originalText": "(2) The organisation must be:\n\n(a) an Australian citizen; or\n\nAmendment of the Privacy Act 1988  Schedule 1\n\n(b) a person whose continued presence in Australia is not subject\nto a limitation as to time imposed by law; or\n\n(c) a partnership formed in Australia or an external Territory; or\n\n(d) a trust created in Australia or an external Territory; or\n\n(e) a body corporate incorporated in Australia or an external\nTerritory; or\n\n(f) an unincorporated association that has its central\nmanagement and control in Australia or an external Territory.\nOther link with Australia"
    },
    {
