      "cml:integrityHash": "8155d699b888c42a23017494c91a73bba15f252abd7a213abcee319f93f50fda",
      "skos:note": "Amendment of the Privacy Act 1988 Schedule 1 records in relation to which the Archives has entered into arrangements with a person other than a Commonwealth institution."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/privacy-amendment-private-sector-act-2000#sch-1-sec-25",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "25 Subsection 6(1) (after paragraph (f) of the definition of",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 14,
      "values:originalText": "record)\nInsert:\n\nAmendment of the Privacy Act 1988  Schedule 1\n\n(fa) records (as defined in the Archives Act 1983) in the custody\nof the Archives (as defined in that Act) in relation to which\nthe Archives has entered into arrangements with a person\nother than a Commonwealth institution (as defined in that\nAct) providing for the extent to which the Archives or other\npersons are to have access to the records; or"
    },
