      "values:originalText": "(5) In this section:\n\nSchedule 1  Amendment of the Privacy Act 1988\n\nState does not include the Australian Capital Territory or the\nNorthern Territory (despite subsection 6(1)).",
      "skos:definition": "(5) In this section:\n\nSchedule 1  Amendment of the Privacy Act 1988\n\nState does not include the Australian Capital Territory or the\nNorthern Territory (despite subsection 6(1)).",
