    {
      "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-private-sector-act-2000-sch-1-sec-6d-ss-5",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "6D(5) Small business and small business operators",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/privacy-amendment-private-sector-act-2000#sch-1-sec-6d-ss-5"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "privacy-amendment-private-sector-act-2000.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "privacy-amendment-private-sector-act-2000.pdf, p.22",
      "values:originalText": "(5) Subsection (4) does not prevent an individual from being a small\nbusiness operator merely because he or she does something\ndescribed in paragraph (4)(b), (c) or (d):\n\n(a) otherwise than in the course of a business he or she carries\non; and\n\n(b) only for the purposes of, or in connection with, his or her\npersonal, family or household affairs.\nNon-business affairs of other small business operators",
      "skos:definition": "(5) Subsection (4) does not prevent an individual from being a small\nbusiness operator merely because he or she does something\ndescribed in paragraph (4)(b), (c) or (d):\n\n(a) otherwise than in the course of a business he or she carries\non; and\n\n(b) only for the purposes of, or in connection with, his or her\npersonal, family or household affairs.\nNon-business affairs of other small business operators",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-private-sector-act-2000-sch-1-sec-6d"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-private-sector-act-2000-sch-1-sec-6d-ss-5-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-private-sector-act-2000-sch-1-sec-6d-ss-5-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "93b653a8042b394bc65e0a132d2f057eadfe0c4cf45918cced523a55d091fb32",
      "skos:note": "Exempts individuals from being a small business operator under certain conditions."
    },
