    {
      "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-private-sector-act-2000-sch-1-sec-6d-ss-8",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "6D(8) Small business and small business operators",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/privacy-amendment-private-sector-act-2000#sch-1-sec-6d-ss-8"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "privacy-amendment-private-sector-act-2000.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "privacy-amendment-private-sector-act-2000.pdf, p.22",
      "values:originalText": "(8) Paragraph (4)(d) does not prevent an individual, body corporate,\npartnership, unincorporated association or trust from being a small\nbusiness operator only because he, she or it:\n\n(a) collects personal information about another individual from\nsomeone else:\n\n(i) with the consent of the other individual; or\n\n(ii) as required or authorised by or under legislation; and\n\n(b) provides a benefit, service or advantage to be allowed to\ncollect the information.\n\nSchedule 1  Amendment of the Privacy Act 1988\n\nRelated bodies corporate",
      "skos:definition": "(8) Paragraph (4)(d) does not prevent an individual, body corporate,\npartnership, unincorporated association or trust from being a small\nbusiness operator only because he, she or it:\n\n(a) collects personal information about another individual from\nsomeone else:\n\n(i) with the consent of the other individual; or\n\n(ii) as required or authorised by or under legislation; and\n\n(b) provides a benefit, service or advantage to be allowed to\ncollect the information.\n\nSchedule 1  Amendment of the Privacy Act 1988\n\nRelated bodies corporate",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-private-sector-act-2000-sch-1-sec-6d"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-private-sector-act-2000-sch-1-sec-6d-ss-8-norm"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "f21f0f9818bd2ba15bfc5adc987c695052f7071eb1657f844c9a08f15050ea52",
      "skos:note": "Small business and small business operators are not prevented from collecting personal information."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/privacy-amendment-private-sector-act-2000#sch-1-sec-6d-ss-8",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
