          "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-private-sector-act-2000-sch-1-sec-6ea-ss-3-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-private-sector-act-2000-sch-1-sec-6ea-ss-3-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "781910a5180dc34e5009a159c29ed7e404663b7d240d33b4afd269447112a2c6",
      "skos:note": "Must enter operator's name and ABN in a register.",
      "dc:description": "Yes"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/privacy-amendment-private-sector-act-2000#sch-1-sec-6ea-ss-3",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "6EA(3) Small business operators choosing to be treated as",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 26,
      "values:originalText": "(3) If the Commissioner is satisfied that a small business operator has\nmade the choice to be treated as an organisation, the Commissioner\nmust enter in a register of operators who have made such a choice:\n\n(a) the name or names under which the operator carries on\nbusiness; and\n\n(b) the operator’s ABN, if the operator has one under the A New\nTax System (Australian Business Number) Act 1999."
    },
