      "values:originalText": "Insert:\n\nSchedule 1  Amendment of the Privacy Act 1988\n\n(ee) an act done, or a practice engaged in, by an organisation,\nother than an exempt act or exempt practice (see sections 7B\nand 7C);",
      "skos:definition": "Insert:\n\nSchedule 1  Amendment of the Privacy Act 1988\n\n(ee) an act done, or a practice engaged in, by an organisation,\nother than an exempt act or exempt practice (see sections 7B\nand 7C);",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-private-sector-act-2000-sch-1-sec-39-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-private-sector-act-2000-sch-1-sec-39-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "65bf8e61d575fddd6f49d6bdce537d99653ecb1079fe2991a818389c8519406a",
      "skos:note": "An organisation must not engage in a practice without an exempt act or exempt practice."
    },
    {
