      "cml:integrityHash": "d1ba9cddc67ca44062b8db87dd18416fb82e2a120151fe38b71fa372b505f133",
      "skos:note": "Acts of certain agencies treated as acts of organisation"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/privacy-amendment-private-sector-act-2000#sch-1-sec-7a-ss-3",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "7A(3) Acts of certain agencies treated as acts of organisation",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 28,
      "values:originalText": "(3) Subsection (1) also applies to acts and practices that:\n\n(a) are done or engaged in by an agency specified in Division 1\nof Part II of Schedule 2 to the Freedom of Information Act\n1982 in relation to documents in respect of its commercial\nactivities or the commercial activities of another entity; and\n\n(b) relate to those commercial activities."
    },
