    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/privacy-amendment-private-sector-act-2000#sch-1-sec-7b-ss-5",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "7B(5) Exempt acts and exempt practices of organisations",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 29,
      "values:originalText": "(5) An act done, or practice engaged in, by an organisation is exempt\nfor the purposes of paragraph 7(1)(ee) if:\n\n(a) the organisation is a contracted service provider for a State\ncontract (whether or not the organisation is a party to the\ncontract); and\n\n(b) the act is done, or the practice is engaged in for the purposes\nof meeting (directly or indirectly) an obligation under the\ncontract."
    },
