      "dc:source": "privacy-amendment-private-sector-act-2000.pdf, p.32",
      "values:originalText": "After “the agency”, insert “or organisation”.\n\nAmendment of the Privacy Act 1988  Schedule 1",
      "skos:definition": "After “the agency”, insert “or organisation”.\n\nAmendment of the Privacy Act 1988  Schedule 1",
