      "dc:source": "privacy-amendment-private-sector-act-2000.pdf, p.33",
      "values:originalText": "(3) For the purposes of the application of this Act in relation to an\norganisation that is a partnership:\n\n(a) an act done or practice engaged in by a partner is taken to\nhave been done or engaged in by the organisation; and\n\n(b) a communication (including a complaint, notice, request or\ndisclosure of information) made to a partner is taken to have\nbeen made to the organisation.",
      "skos:definition": "(3) For the purposes of the application of this Act in relation to an\norganisation that is a partnership:\n\n(a) an act done or practice engaged in by a partner is taken to\nhave been done or engaged in by the organisation; and\n\n(b) a communication (including a complaint, notice, request or\ndisclosure of information) made to a partner is taken to have\nbeen made to the organisation.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-private-sector-act-2000-sch-1-sec-47"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-private-sector-act-2000-sch-1-sec-47-ss-3-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-private-sector-act-2000-sch-1-sec-47-ss-3-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "61f0e2f5cc374ddec8ab905044b4d11c771f3dc772bd7b2057ed6790a03fdfb2",
      "skos:note": "An act done by a partner is taken to have been done by the organisation."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/privacy-amendment-private-sector-act-2000#sch-1-sec-47-ss-3",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "47(3) At the end of section 8",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 33,
      "values:originalText": "(3) For the purposes of the application of this Act in relation to an\norganisation that is a partnership:\n\n(a) an act done or practice engaged in by a partner is taken to\nhave been done or engaged in by the organisation; and\n\n(b) a communication (including a complaint, notice, request or\ndisclosure of information) made to a partner is taken to have\nbeen made to the organisation."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-private-sector-act-2000-sch-1-sec-47-ss-3-norm",
      "@type": "values:Obligation",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-private-sector-act-2000-sch-1-sec-47-ss-3"
      },
      "values:deonticStatus": {
