      "skos:note": "Severability: additional effect of Act in relation to organisations"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/privacy-amendment-private-sector-act-2000#sch-1-sec-12b-ss-7",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "12B(7) Severability: additional effect of Act in relation to organisations",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 33,
      "values:originalText": "(7) This Act also has the effect it would have if its operation in relation\nto organisations were expressly confined to acts or practices of\norganisations taking place in a Territory."
    },
