      "values:originalText": "(2) This Act (except Divisions 4 and 5 of Part III and Part IIIA)\napplies to personal information that has been collected by an\norganisation only if the information is held by the organisation in a\nrecord.\n\nSchedule 1  Amendment of the Privacy Act 1988",
      "skos:definition": "(2) This Act (except Divisions 4 and 5 of Part III and Part IIIA)\napplies to personal information that has been collected by an\norganisation only if the information is held by the organisation in a\nrecord.\n\nSchedule 1  Amendment of the Privacy Act 1988",
      "values:partOf": {
