      "skos:note": "National Privacy Principles apply to organisation after delayed application period."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/privacy-amendment-private-sector-act-2000#sch-1-sec-16d-ss-3",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "16D(3) Delayed application of National Privacy Principles to small",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 40,
      "values:originalText": "(3) National Privacy Principles 3 (so far as it relates to personal\ninformation used or disclosed), 4, 5, 7 and 9 apply in relation to the\norganisation only after the delayed application period. Those\nPrinciples then apply in relation to personal information held by\nthe organisation as a result of collection occurring before, during or\nafter that period."
    },
