    {
      "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-private-sector-act-2000-sch-1-sec-16d-ss-6",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "16D(6) Delayed application of National Privacy Principles to small",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/privacy-amendment-private-sector-act-2000#sch-1-sec-16d-ss-6"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "privacy-amendment-private-sector-act-2000.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "privacy-amendment-private-sector-act-2000.pdf, p.40",
      "values:originalText": "(6) In this section:\ndelayed application period, for an organisation, means the period:\n\n(a) starting at the later of the following times:\n\n(i) the start of the day when this section commences;\n\n(ii) when the organisation became an organisation; and\n\n(b) ending at the earlier of the following times:\n\n(i) immediately before the first anniversary of the day\nwhen this section commences;\n\n(ii) when the organisation carries on either a business that is\nnot a small business or a business that involves the\nprovision of health services.",
      "skos:definition": "(6) In this section:\ndelayed application period, for an organisation, means the period:\n\n(a) starting at the later of the following times:\n\n(i) the start of the day when this section commences;\n\n(ii) when the organisation became an organisation; and\n\n(b) ending at the earlier of the following times:\n\n(i) immediately before the first anniversary of the day\nwhen this section commences;\n\n(ii) when the organisation carries on either a business that is\nnot a small business or a business that involves the\nprovision of health services.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-private-sector-act-2000-sch-1-sec-16d"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-private-sector-act-2000-sch-1-sec-16d-ss-6-norm"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "c305824762d9c386517ae9c04f97086b6c2084b6e0fe2ba917efb0c7634d7142",
      "skos:note": "Defines delayed application period for small organisations."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/privacy-amendment-private-sector-act-2000#sch-1-sec-16d-ss-6",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "16D(6) Delayed application of National Privacy Principles to small",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 40,
      "values:originalText": "(6) In this section:\ndelayed application period, for an organisation, means the period:\n\n(a) starting at the later of the following times:\n\n(i) the start of the day when this section commences;\n\n(ii) when the organisation became an organisation; and\n\n(b) ending at the earlier of the following times:\n\n(i) immediately before the first anniversary of the day\nwhen this section commences;\n\n(ii) when the organisation carries on either a business that is\nnot a small business or a business that involves the\nprovision of health services."
    },
    {
