      "values:originalText": "(6) This section does not prevent the Commissioner approving a\nprivacy code if:\n\n(a) the code also sets out:\n\n(i) the period during which it will operate; or\n\n(ii) the circumstances in which it will expire; and\n\n(b) the Commissioner considers that the period or circumstances\nare appropriate.",
      "skos:definition": "(6) This section does not prevent the Commissioner approving a\nprivacy code if:\n\n(a) the code also sets out:\n\n(i) the period during which it will operate; or\n\n(ii) the circumstances in which it will expire; and\n\n(b) the Commissioner considers that the period or circumstances\nare appropriate.",
