    {
      "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-private-sector-act-2000-sch-1-sec-18bh",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "18BH Review of operation of approved privacy code",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/privacy-amendment-private-sector-act-2000#sch-1-sec-18bh"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "privacy-amendment-private-sector-act-2000.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "privacy-amendment-private-sector-act-2000.pdf, p.48",
      "values:originalText": "(1) The Commissioner may review the operation of an approved\nprivacy code.\nNote:\nThe review may inform a decision by the Commissioner under\nsection 18BE to revoke the approved privacy code.\n\n(2) The Commissioner may do one or more of the following for the\npurposes of the review:\n\n(a) consider the process under the code for making and dealing\nwith complaints;\n\n(b) inspect the records of an adjudicator for the code;\n\n(c) consider the outcome of complaints dealt with under the\ncode;\n\n(d) interview an adjudicator for the code.",
      "skos:definition": "(1) The Commissioner may review the operation of an approved\nprivacy code.\nNote:\nThe review may inform a decision by the Commissioner under\nsection 18BE to revoke the approved privacy code.\n\n(2) The Commissioner may do one or more of the following for the\npurposes of the review:\n\n(a) consider the process under the code for making and dealing\nwith complaints;\n\n(b) inspect the records of an adjudicator for the code;\n\n(c) consider the outcome of complaints dealt with under the\ncode;\n\n(d) interview an adjudicator for the code.",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-private-sector-act-2000-sch-1-sec-18bh-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-private-sector-act-2000-sch-1-sec-18bh-ss-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "6e45bedd5da3ce72a58fd761253d37e0961684777d09b18b0b8dd1e32d03f7cf"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/privacy-amendment-private-sector-act-2000#sch-1-sec-18bh",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "18BH Review of operation of approved privacy code",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 48,
      "values:originalText": "(1) The Commissioner may review the operation of an approved\nprivacy code.\nNote:\nThe review may inform a decision by the Commissioner under\nsection 18BE to revoke the approved privacy code.\n\n(2) The Commissioner may do one or more of the following for the\npurposes of the review:\n\n(a) consider the process under the code for making and dealing\nwith complaints;\n\n(b) inspect the records of an adjudicator for the code;\n\n(c) consider the outcome of complaints dealt with under the\ncode;\n\n(d) interview an adjudicator for the code."
    },
