      "dc:source": "privacy-amendment-private-sector-act-2000.pdf, p.48",
      "values:originalText": "(2) The Commissioner may do one or more of the following for the\npurposes of the review:\n\n(a) consider the process under the code for making and dealing\nwith complaints;\n\n(b) inspect the records of an adjudicator for the code;\n\n(c) consider the outcome of complaints dealt with under the\ncode;\n\n(d) interview an adjudicator for the code.",
      "skos:definition": "(2) The Commissioner may do one or more of the following for the\npurposes of the review:\n\n(a) consider the process under the code for making and dealing\nwith complaints;\n\n(b) inspect the records of an adjudicator for the code;\n\n(c) consider the outcome of complaints dealt with under the\ncode;\n\n(d) interview an adjudicator for the code.",
