      "dc:source": "privacy-amendment-private-sector-act-2000.pdf, p.54",
      "values:originalText": "(3) The Commissioner must accept the complaint under subsection\n40(1B).\nNote:\nThis means that the Commissioner must investigate the complaint\n(subject to section 41) as if the complaint had been made to the\nCommissioner under section 36. See subsections 40(1B) and (1C).",
      "skos:definition": "(3) The Commissioner must accept the complaint under subsection\n40(1B).\nNote:\nThis means that the Commissioner must investigate the complaint\n(subject to section 41) as if the complaint had been made to the\nCommissioner under section 36. See subsections 40(1B) and (1C).",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-private-sector-act-2000-sch-1-sec-40a"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
