      "skos:note": "Commissioner must investigate complaint as if made under section 36."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/privacy-amendment-private-sector-act-2000#sch-1-sec-40a-ss-3",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "40A(3) Referring complaint about act under Commonwealth contract",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 54,
      "values:originalText": "(3) The Commissioner must accept the complaint under subsection\n40(1B).\nNote:\nThis means that the Commissioner must investigate the complaint\n(subject to section 41) as if the complaint had been made to the\nCommissioner under section 36. See subsections 40(1B) and (1C)."
    },
