      },
      "dc:source": "privacy-amendment-private-sector-act-2000.pdf, p.56",
      "values:originalText": "Add:\n\n(2) If the Commissioner decides not to investigate (at all or further) an\nact done, or practice engaged in, by a contracted service provider\nfor the purpose of providing (directly or indirectly) a service to an\nagency under a Commonwealth contract, the Commissioner must\nalso inform the agency of the decision.\nNote:\nSee subsection 6(9) about provision of services to an agency.",
      "skos:definition": "Add:\n\n(2) If the Commissioner decides not to investigate (at all or further) an\nact done, or practice engaged in, by a contracted service provider\nfor the purpose of providing (directly or indirectly) a service to an\nagency under a Commonwealth contract, the Commissioner must\nalso inform the agency of the decision.\nNote:\nSee subsection 6(9) about provision of services to an agency.",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-private-sector-act-2000-sch-1-sec-93-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-private-sector-act-2000-sch-1-sec-93-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "31d6c62f7fb7d4034851189df56eb07ba82b5c120e6a3b6fde3efe4ae0e611fe",
      "skos:note": "Inform agency of decision not to investigate contracted service provider"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/privacy-amendment-private-sector-act-2000#sch-1-sec-93",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "93 At the end of section 48",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 56,
      "values:originalText": "Add:\n\n(2) If the Commissioner decides not to investigate (at all or further) an\nact done, or practice engaged in, by a contracted service provider\nfor the purpose of providing (directly or indirectly) a service to an\nagency under a Commonwealth contract, the Commissioner must\nalso inform the agency of the decision.\nNote:\nSee subsection 6(9) about provision of services to an agency."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-private-sector-act-2000-sch-1-sec-93-norm",
