    {
      "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-private-sector-act-2000-sch-1-sec-95",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "95 Subsection 52(3A)",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/privacy-amendment-private-sector-act-2000#sch-1-sec-95"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "privacy-amendment-private-sector-act-2000.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "privacy-amendment-private-sector-act-2000.pdf, p.57",
      "values:originalText": "Repeal the subsection, substitute:\n\nSchedule 1  Amendment of the Privacy Act 1988\n\n(3A) The Commissioner may include an order mentioned in\nsubsection (3B) in a determination under subparagraph (1)(b)(i) or\n(ii) that concerns a breach of:\n\n(a) Information Privacy Principle 7; or\n\n(b) National Privacy Principle 6, to the extent that it deals with\nthe correction of personal information; or\n\n(c) a provision of an approved privacy code that corresponds to\nNational Privacy Principle 6, to the extent that it deals with\nthe correction of personal information; or\n\n(d) section 18J.\n\n(3B) A determination may include an order that:\n\n(a) an agency or respondent make an appropriate correction,\ndeletion or addition to a record, or to a credit information file\nor credit report, as the case may be; or\n\n(b) an agency or respondent attach to a record, or include in a\ncredit information file or credit report, as the case may be, a\nstatement provided by the complainant of a correction,\ndeletion or addition sought by the complainant.",
      "skos:definition": "Repeal the subsection, substitute:\n\nSchedule 1  Amendment of the Privacy Act 1988\n\n(3A) The Commissioner may include an order mentioned in\nsubsection (3B) in a determination under subparagraph (1)(b)(i) or\n(ii) that concerns a breach of:\n\n(a) Information Privacy Principle 7; or\n\n(b) National Privacy Principle 6, to the extent that it deals with\nthe correction of personal information; or\n\n(c) a provision of an approved privacy code that corresponds to\nNational Privacy Principle 6, to the extent that it deals with\nthe correction of personal information; or\n\n(d) section 18J.\n\n(3B) A determination may include an order that:\n\n(a) an agency or respondent make an appropriate correction,\ndeletion or addition to a record, or to a credit information file\nor credit report, as the case may be; or\n\n(b) an agency or respondent attach to a record, or include in a\ncredit information file or credit report, as the case may be, a\nstatement provided by the complainant of a correction,\ndeletion or addition sought by the complainant.",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-private-sector-act-2000-sch-1-sec-95-ss-3a"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-private-sector-act-2000-sch-1-sec-95-ss-3b"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "3da5b7ebd043c87d69abc790b9648a6784dc637a2a7338cbf2ccffae98741522"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/privacy-amendment-private-sector-act-2000#sch-1-sec-95",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "95 Subsection 52(3A)",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 57,
      "values:originalText": "Repeal the subsection, substitute:\n\nSchedule 1  Amendment of the Privacy Act 1988\n\n(3A) The Commissioner may include an order mentioned in\nsubsection (3B) in a determination under subparagraph (1)(b)(i) or\n(ii) that concerns a breach of:\n\n(a) Information Privacy Principle 7; or\n\n(b) National Privacy Principle 6, to the extent that it deals with\nthe correction of personal information; or\n\n(c) a provision of an approved privacy code that corresponds to\nNational Privacy Principle 6, to the extent that it deals with\nthe correction of personal information; or\n\n(d) section 18J.\n\n(3B) A determination may include an order that:\n\n(a) an agency or respondent make an appropriate correction,\ndeletion or addition to a record, or to a credit information file\nor credit report, as the case may be; or\n\n(b) an agency or respondent attach to a record, or include in a\ncredit information file or credit report, as the case may be, a\nstatement provided by the complainant of a correction,\ndeletion or addition sought by the complainant."
    },
