    {
      "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-private-sector-act-2000-sch-1-sec-53b-ss-3",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "53B(3) Substituting respondent to determination",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/privacy-amendment-private-sector-act-2000#sch-1-sec-53b-ss-3"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "privacy-amendment-private-sector-act-2000.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "privacy-amendment-private-sector-act-2000.pdf, p.59",
      "values:originalText": "(3) Before making a determination, the Commissioner must give the\nagency:\n\nSchedule 1  Amendment of the Privacy Act 1988\n\n(a) a notice stating that the Commissioner proposes to make the\ndetermination and stating the reasons for the proposal; and\n\n(b) an opportunity to appear before the Commissioner and to\nmake oral and/or written submissions relating to the proposed\ndetermination.",
      "skos:definition": "(3) Before making a determination, the Commissioner must give the\nagency:\n\nSchedule 1  Amendment of the Privacy Act 1988\n\n(a) a notice stating that the Commissioner proposes to make the\ndetermination and stating the reasons for the proposal; and\n\n(b) an opportunity to appear before the Commissioner and to\nmake oral and/or written submissions relating to the proposed\ndetermination.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-private-sector-act-2000-sch-1-sec-53b"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-private-sector-act-2000-sch-1-sec-53b-ss-3-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-private-sector-act-2000-sch-1-sec-53b-ss-3-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "7bca60abf48837cfa41d10a88d58bb6c24d0f3c406559acc2a9bdd2d73b2ea9a",
      "skos:note": "Notice and opportunity to appear before the Commissioner",
      "dc:description": "Notice stating proposal and reasons, opportunity to make submissions"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/privacy-amendment-private-sector-act-2000#sch-1-sec-53b-ss-3",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "53B(3) Substituting respondent to determination",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 59,
      "values:originalText": "(3) Before making a determination, the Commissioner must give the\nagency:\n\nSchedule 1  Amendment of the Privacy Act 1988\n\n(a) a notice stating that the Commissioner proposes to make the\ndetermination and stating the reasons for the proposal; and\n\n(b) an opportunity to appear before the Commissioner and to\nmake oral and/or written submissions relating to the proposed\ndetermination."
    },
