    {
      "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-private-sector-act-2000-sch-1-sec-55-2",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "55 Obligations of respondent organisation",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/privacy-amendment-private-sector-act-2000#sch-1-sec-55-2"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "privacy-amendment-private-sector-act-2000.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "privacy-amendment-private-sector-act-2000.pdf, p.60",
      "values:originalText": "Determination under section 52\n\n(1) An organisation that is the respondent to a determination made\nunder section 52:\n\n(a) must not repeat or continue conduct that is covered by a\ndeclaration that is included in the determination under\nsub-subparagraph 52(1)(b)(i)(B); and\n\n(b) must perform the act or course of conduct that is covered by\na declaration that is included in the determination under\nsubparagraph 52(1)(b)(ii).\n\nAmendment of the Privacy Act 1988  Schedule 1\n\nDetermination under approved privacy code\n\n(2) An organisation that is the respondent to a determination made\nunder an approved privacy code:\n\n(a) must not repeat or continue conduct that is covered by a\ndeclaration that is included in the determination and that\ncorresponds to a declaration mentioned in paragraph (1)(a);\nand\n\n(b) must perform the act or course of conduct that is covered by\na declaration that is included in the determination and that\ncorresponds to a declaration mentioned in paragraph (1)(b).",
      "skos:definition": "Determination under section 52\n\n(1) An organisation that is the respondent to a determination made\nunder section 52:\n\n(a) must not repeat or continue conduct that is covered by a\ndeclaration that is included in the determination under\nsub-subparagraph 52(1)(b)(i)(B); and\n\n(b) must perform the act or course of conduct that is covered by\na declaration that is included in the determination under\nsubparagraph 52(1)(b)(ii).\n\nAmendment of the Privacy Act 1988  Schedule 1\n\nDetermination under approved privacy code\n\n(2) An organisation that is the respondent to a determination made\nunder an approved privacy code:\n\n(a) must not repeat or continue conduct that is covered by a\ndeclaration that is included in the determination and that\ncorresponds to a declaration mentioned in paragraph (1)(a);\nand\n\n(b) must perform the act or course of conduct that is covered by\na declaration that is included in the determination and that\ncorresponds to a declaration mentioned in paragraph (1)(b).",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-private-sector-act-2000-sch-1-sec-55-2-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-private-sector-act-2000-sch-1-sec-55-2-ss-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "983d9d54cda35be6a06b868066c65150b71025cabf6132562591f9538ee9dcda"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/privacy-amendment-private-sector-act-2000#sch-1-sec-55-2",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "55 Obligations of respondent organisation",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 60,
      "values:originalText": "Determination under section 52\n\n(1) An organisation that is the respondent to a determination made\nunder section 52:\n\n(a) must not repeat or continue conduct that is covered by a\ndeclaration that is included in the determination under\nsub-subparagraph 52(1)(b)(i)(B); and\n\n(b) must perform the act or course of conduct that is covered by\na declaration that is included in the determination under\nsubparagraph 52(1)(b)(ii).\n\nAmendment of the Privacy Act 1988  Schedule 1\n\nDetermination under approved privacy code\n\n(2) An organisation that is the respondent to a determination made\nunder an approved privacy code:\n\n(a) must not repeat or continue conduct that is covered by a\ndeclaration that is included in the determination and that\ncorresponds to a declaration mentioned in paragraph (1)(a);\nand\n\n(b) must perform the act or course of conduct that is covered by\na declaration that is included in the determination and that\ncorresponds to a declaration mentioned in paragraph (1)(b)."
    },
    {
