    {
      "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-private-sector-act-2000-sch-1-sec-122",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "122 Subsection 75(2)",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/privacy-amendment-private-sector-act-2000#sch-1-sec-122"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "privacy-amendment-private-sector-act-2000.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "privacy-amendment-private-sector-act-2000.pdf, p.68",
      "values:originalText": "Amendment of the Privacy Act 1988  Schedule 1\n\nRepeal the subsection, substitute:\n\n(2) If the applicant is an agency, the Commissioner must send to the\nagency, and to each other person (if any) who is interested in the\napplication, a written invitation to notify the Commissioner, within\nthe period specified in the invitation, whether or not the agency or\nother person wishes the Commissioner to hold a conference about\nthe draft determination.\n\n(2A) If the applicant is an organisation, the Commissioner must:\n\n(a) send a written invitation to the organisation to notify the\nCommissioner, within the period specified in the invitation,\nwhether or not the organisation wishes the Commissioner to\nhold a conference about the draft determination; and\n\n(b) issue, in any way the Commissioner thinks appropriate, an\ninvitation in corresponding terms to the other persons (if any)\nthat the Commissioner thinks appropriate.",
      "skos:definition": "Amendment of the Privacy Act 1988  Schedule 1\n\nRepeal the subsection, substitute:\n\n(2) If the applicant is an agency, the Commissioner must send to the\nagency, and to each other person (if any) who is interested in the\napplication, a written invitation to notify the Commissioner, within\nthe period specified in the invitation, whether or not the agency or\nother person wishes the Commissioner to hold a conference about\nthe draft determination.\n\n(2A) If the applicant is an organisation, the Commissioner must:\n\n(a) send a written invitation to the organisation to notify the\nCommissioner, within the period specified in the invitation,\nwhether or not the organisation wishes the Commissioner to\nhold a conference about the draft determination; and\n\n(b) issue, in any way the Commissioner thinks appropriate, an\ninvitation in corresponding terms to the other persons (if any)\nthat the Commissioner thinks appropriate.",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-private-sector-act-2000-sch-1-sec-122-ss-2"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-private-sector-act-2000-sch-1-sec-122-ss-2a"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "c326d2cfaffe43f047fcaa0272147aa14140426af71b5c2d9c7112575187a9a7"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/privacy-amendment-private-sector-act-2000#sch-1-sec-122",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "122 Subsection 75(2)",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 68,
      "values:originalText": "Amendment of the Privacy Act 1988  Schedule 1\n\nRepeal the subsection, substitute:\n\n(2) If the applicant is an agency, the Commissioner must send to the\nagency, and to each other person (if any) who is interested in the\napplication, a written invitation to notify the Commissioner, within\nthe period specified in the invitation, whether or not the agency or\nother person wishes the Commissioner to hold a conference about\nthe draft determination.\n\n(2A) If the applicant is an organisation, the Commissioner must:\n\n(a) send a written invitation to the organisation to notify the\nCommissioner, within the period specified in the invitation,\nwhether or not the organisation wishes the Commissioner to\nhold a conference about the draft determination; and\n\n(b) issue, in any way the Commissioner thinks appropriate, an\ninvitation in corresponding terms to the other persons (if any)\nthat the Commissioner thinks appropriate."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-private-sector-act-2000-sch-1-sec-122-ss-2",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "122(2) Subsection 75(2)",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/privacy-amendment-private-sector-act-2000#sch-1-sec-122-ss-2"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "privacy-amendment-private-sector-act-2000.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "privacy-amendment-private-sector-act-2000.pdf, p.68",
      "values:originalText": "(2) If the applicant is an agency, the Commissioner must send to the\nagency, and to each other person (if any) who is interested in the\napplication, a written invitation to notify the Commissioner, within\nthe period specified in the invitation, whether or not the agency or\nother person wishes the Commissioner to hold a conference about\nthe draft determination.",
      "skos:definition": "(2) If the applicant is an agency, the Commissioner must send to the\nagency, and to each other person (if any) who is interested in the\napplication, a written invitation to notify the Commissioner, within\nthe period specified in the invitation, whether or not the agency or\nother person wishes the Commissioner to hold a conference about\nthe draft determination.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-private-sector-act-2000-sch-1-sec-122"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-private-sector-act-2000-sch-1-sec-122-ss-2-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-private-sector-act-2000-sch-1-sec-122-ss-2-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "6e0db7b74cb97115a1251fdad704302532dce45132cb5bce5a1f5e9ef31292b5",
      "skos:note": "Agency must notify Commissioner within specified period"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/privacy-amendment-private-sector-act-2000#sch-1-sec-122-ss-2",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "122(2) Subsection 75(2)",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 68,
      "values:originalText": "(2) If the applicant is an agency, the Commissioner must send to the\nagency, and to each other person (if any) who is interested in the\napplication, a written invitation to notify the Commissioner, within\nthe period specified in the invitation, whether or not the agency or\nother person wishes the Commissioner to hold a conference about\nthe draft determination."
    },
