    {
      "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-private-sector-act-2000-sch-1-sec-124",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "124 Application and saving",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/privacy-amendment-private-sector-act-2000#sch-1-sec-124"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "privacy-amendment-private-sector-act-2000.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "privacy-amendment-private-sector-act-2000.pdf, p.69",
      "values:originalText": "(1)\nThe amendments of section 75 of the Privacy Act 1988 made by this\nSchedule apply in relation to applications that are made under\nsection 73 of that Act after the commencement of this Schedule.\n(2)\nRegulations (if any) in force for the purposes of subsection 75(3) of the\nPrivacy Act 1988 immediately before the commencement of this\nSchedule have effect, after that commencement, as if they had been\nmade for the purposes of that subsection after that commencement.\n(3)\nSubitem (2) does not prevent the amendment or repeal of the\nregulations.",
      "skos:definition": "(1)\nThe amendments of section 75 of the Privacy Act 1988 made by this\nSchedule apply in relation to applications that are made under\nsection 73 of that Act after the commencement of this Schedule.\n(2)\nRegulations (if any) in force for the purposes of subsection 75(3) of the\nPrivacy Act 1988 immediately before the commencement of this\nSchedule have effect, after that commencement, as if they had been\nmade for the purposes of that subsection after that commencement.\n(3)\nSubitem (2) does not prevent the amendment or repeal of the\nregulations.",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-private-sector-act-2000-sch-1-sec-124-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-private-sector-act-2000-sch-1-sec-124-logic-alleninterval-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "0a677fc0c24b9748a4a589dfc8dccb38d19fec4f23feafab26703862be07d520",
      "skos:note": "Application and saving provisions for amendments to section 75 of the Privacy Act 1988."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/privacy-amendment-private-sector-act-2000#sch-1-sec-124",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "124 Application and saving",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 69,
      "values:originalText": "(1)\nThe amendments of section 75 of the Privacy Act 1988 made by this\nSchedule apply in relation to applications that are made under\nsection 73 of that Act after the commencement of this Schedule.\n(2)\nRegulations (if any) in force for the purposes of subsection 75(3) of the\nPrivacy Act 1988 immediately before the commencement of this\nSchedule have effect, after that commencement, as if they had been\nmade for the purposes of that subsection after that commencement.\n(3)\nSubitem (2) does not prevent the amendment or repeal of the\nregulations."
    },
    {
