      "dc:source": "privacy-amendment-private-sector-act-2000.pdf, p.72",
      "values:originalText": "Section 80A of the Privacy Act 1988 as amended by this Schedule\napplies in relation to an application made by or on behalf of an agency\nunder section 73 of that Act, whether the application was made before\nor after the commencement of this Schedule.",
      "skos:definition": "Section 80A of the Privacy Act 1988 as amended by this Schedule\napplies in relation to an application made by or on behalf of an agency\nunder section 73 of that Act, whether the application was made before\nor after the commencement of this Schedule.",
