    {
      "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-private-sector-act-2000-sch-1-sec-95b-ss-4",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "95B(4) Requirements for Commonwealth contracts",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/privacy-amendment-private-sector-act-2000#sch-1-sec-95b-ss-4"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "privacy-amendment-private-sector-act-2000.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "privacy-amendment-private-sector-act-2000.pdf, p.74",
      "values:originalText": "(4) For the purposes of subsection (3), a subcontract is a contract\nunder which a contracted service provider for the Commonwealth\ncontract is engaged to provide services to:\n\n(a) another contracted service provider for the Commonwealth\ncontract; or\n\n(b) any agency;\nfor the purposes (whether direct or indirect) of the Commonwealth\ncontract.",
      "skos:definition": "(4) For the purposes of subsection (3), a subcontract is a contract\nunder which a contracted service provider for the Commonwealth\ncontract is engaged to provide services to:\n\n(a) another contracted service provider for the Commonwealth\ncontract; or\n\n(b) any agency;\nfor the purposes (whether direct or indirect) of the Commonwealth\ncontract.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-private-sector-act-2000-sch-1-sec-95b"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-private-sector-act-2000-sch-1-sec-95b-ss-4-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-private-sector-act-2000-sch-1-sec-95b-ss-4-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "3c7f034850e38b4c11910a840f45acc15958c6da0357437d67b968137d9385be",
      "skos:note": "Subcontract is a contract under which a contracted service provider provides services to another contracted service provider or an agency."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/privacy-amendment-private-sector-act-2000#sch-1-sec-95b-ss-4",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "95B(4) Requirements for Commonwealth contracts",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 74,
      "values:originalText": "(4) For the purposes of subsection (3), a subcontract is a contract\nunder which a contracted service provider for the Commonwealth\ncontract is engaged to provide services to:\n\n(a) another contracted service provider for the Commonwealth\ncontract; or\n\n(b) any agency;\nfor the purposes (whether direct or indirect) of the Commonwealth\ncontract."
    },
