      "dc:source": "privacy-amendment-private-sector-act-2000.pdf, p.74",
      "values:originalText": "(5) This section applies whether the agency is entering into the\nCommonwealth contract on behalf of the Commonwealth or in the\nagency’s own right.\n\nAmendment of the Privacy Act 1988  Schedule 1",
      "skos:definition": "(5) This section applies whether the agency is entering into the\nCommonwealth contract on behalf of the Commonwealth or in the\nagency’s own right.\n\nAmendment of the Privacy Act 1988  Schedule 1",
