      "dc:source": "privacy-amendment-private-sector-act-2000.pdf, p.77",
      "values:originalText": "4 If it is reasonable and practicable to do so, an organisation must\ncollect personal information about an individual only from that\nindividual.",
      "skos:definition": "4 If it is reasonable and practicable to do so, an organisation must\ncollect personal information about an individual only from that\nindividual.",
