      },
      "dc:source": "privacy-amendment-private-sector-act-2000.pdf, p.79",
      "values:originalText": "organisation that is a body corporate has collected from a related\nbody corporate as if the organisation’s primary purpose of\ncollection of the information were the primary purpose for which\nthe related body corporate collected the information.\n\nSchedule 1  Amendment of the Privacy Act 1988",
      "skos:definition": "organisation that is a body corporate has collected from a related\nbody corporate as if the organisation’s primary purpose of\ncollection of the information were the primary purpose for which\nthe related body corporate collected the information.\n\nSchedule 1  Amendment of the Privacy Act 1988",
