      "values:originalText": "organisation that is a body corporate has collected from a related\nbody corporate as if the organisation’s primary purpose of\ncollection of the information were the primary purpose for which\nthe related body corporate collected the information.\n\nSchedule 1  Amendment of the Privacy Act 1988"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-private-sector-act-2000-sch-3-sec-2-4-norm",
      "@type": "values:Obligation",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "values:partOf": {
