      },
      "dc:source": "privacy-amendment-private-sector-act-2000.pdf, p.81",
      "values:originalText": "to let the person know, generally, what sort of personal information\nit holds, for what purposes, and how it collects, holds, uses and\ndiscloses that information.\n\nSchedule 1  Amendment of the Privacy Act 1988",
