      },
      "dc:source": "privacy-amendment-private-sector-act-2000.pdf, p.83",
      "values:originalText": "and the individual is able to establish that the information is not\naccurate, complete and up-to-date, the organisation must take\nreasonable steps to correct the information so that it is accurate,\ncomplete and up-to-date.",
      "skos:definition": "and the individual is able to establish that the information is not\naccurate, complete and up-to-date, the organisation must take\nreasonable steps to correct the information so that it is accurate,\ncomplete and up-to-date.",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-private-sector-act-2000-sch-3-sec-6-7-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-private-sector-act-2000-sch-3-sec-6-7-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "eee28c74e202ca1f9fb11fa3357b5e13bcdff36626b8cde3d2861735a10f526c",
      "skos:note": "Organisation must correct inaccurate personal information upon request."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/privacy-amendment-private-sector-act-2000#sch-3-sec-6-7",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "6 5 If an organisation holds personal information about an individual",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 83,
      "values:originalText": "and the individual is able to establish that the information is not\naccurate, complete and up-to-date, the organisation must take\nreasonable steps to correct the information so that it is accurate,\ncomplete and up-to-date."
    },
