        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "(a) the individual has consented; or\n(b) the collection is required by law; or\n(c) the collection is necessary to prevent or lessen a serious and imminent threat to the life or health of any individual, where\nthe individual whom the information concerns:\n(i) is physically or legally incapable of giving consent to\nthe collection; or\n(ii) physically cannot communicate consent to the\ncollection;"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-private-sector-act-2000-sch-3-sec-10-2-logic-deontic-3",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "cml:operator": "Right",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Right to consent for sensitive information collection",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::logic::deontic",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "(d) if the information is collected in the course of the activities of a non-profit organisation—the following conditions are satisfied:\n(i) the information relates solely to the members of the\norganisation or to individuals who have regular contact\nwith it in connection with its activities;\n(ii) at or before the time of collecting the information, the\norganisation undertakes to the individual whom the\ninformation concerns that the organisation will not\ndisclose the information without the individual’s\nconsent;"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-private-sector-act-2000-sch-3-sec-10-2-logic-deontic-4",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "cml:operator": "Obligation",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Obligation to disclose consent for sensitive information collection",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::logic::deontic",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "(ii) at or before the time of collecting the information, the organisation undertakes to the individual whom the\ninformation concerns that the organisation will not\ndisclose the information without the individual’s\nconsent;"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-private-sector-act-2000-sch-3-sec-10-2-logic-deontic-5",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "cml:operator": "Obligation",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Obligation to prevent disclosure of sensitive information",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::logic::deontic",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "(iii) at or before the time of collecting the information, the organisation undertakes to the individual whom the\ninformation concerns that the organisation will not\ndisclose the information without the individual’s\nconsent;"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-private-sector-act-2000-sch-3-sec-10-3",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "10 2 Despite subclause 10.1, an organisation may collect health",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/privacy-amendment-private-sector-act-2000#sch-3-sec-10-3"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "privacy-amendment-private-sector-act-2000.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "privacy-amendment-private-sector-act-2000.pdf, p.86",
      "values:originalText": "information about an individual if:\n\n(a) the information is necessary to provide a health service to the\nindividual; and\n\n(b) the information is collected:\n\n(i) as required by law (other than this Act); or\n\n(ii) in accordance with rules established by competent\nhealth or medical bodies that deal with obligations of\nprofessional confidentiality which bind the organisation.",
      "skos:definition": "information about an individual if:\n\n(a) the information is necessary to provide a health service to the\nindividual; and\n\n(b) the information is collected:\n\n(i) as required by law (other than this Act); or\n\n(ii) in accordance with rules established by competent\nhealth or medical bodies that deal with obligations of\nprofessional confidentiality which bind the organisation.",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-private-sector-act-2000-sch-3-sec-10-3-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-private-sector-act-2000-sch-3-sec-10-3-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "073ef54f3530f0f7159196c9d4f346e659395e83393f4c98b7b615b69159ce6d",
      "skos:note": "Organisation may collect health information under certain conditions."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/privacy-amendment-private-sector-act-2000#sch-3-sec-10-3",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "10 2 Despite subclause 10.1, an organisation may collect health",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 86,
      "values:originalText": "information about an individual if:\n\n(a) the information is necessary to provide a health service to the\nindividual; and\n\n(b) the information is collected:\n\n(i) as required by law (other than this Act); or\n\n(ii) in accordance with rules established by competent\nhealth or medical bodies that deal with obligations of\nprofessional confidentiality which bind the organisation."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-private-sector-act-2000-sch-3-sec-10-3-norm",
      "@type": "values:Obligation",
      "cml:modality": {
