      "dc:source": "privacy-amendment-private-sector-act-2000.pdf, p.89",
      "values:originalText": "Omit “about the development of the code.”, substitute “by the body or\nassociation about the development of the code before the body or\nassociation gave the copy of the code to the ACA; and”.",
      "skos:definition": "Omit “about the development of the code.”, substitute “by the body or\nassociation about the development of the code before the body or\nassociation gave the copy of the code to the ACA; and”.",
