    {
      "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-private-sector-act-2000-sch-2-sec-9",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "9 After subsection 118(4)",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/privacy-amendment-private-sector-act-2000#sch-2-sec-9"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "privacy-amendment-private-sector-act-2000.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "privacy-amendment-private-sector-act-2000.pdf, p.90",
      "values:originalText": "Insert:\n\n(4A) The ACA must consult the Privacy Commissioner before making a\nrequest under subsection (1) for the development of an industry\ncode that could reasonably be expected to deal directly or\nindirectly with a matter dealt with by:\n\n(a) the National Privacy Principles (as defined in the Privacy Act\n1988); or\n\n(b) other provisions of that Act relating to those Principles; or\n\n(c) an approved privacy code (as defined in that Act) that binds\none or more participants in the section of the\ntelecommunications industry to which the request relates; or\n\n(d) provisions of that Act that relate to the approved privacy\ncode.",
      "skos:definition": "Insert:\n\n(4A) The ACA must consult the Privacy Commissioner before making a\nrequest under subsection (1) for the development of an industry\ncode that could reasonably be expected to deal directly or\nindirectly with a matter dealt with by:\n\n(a) the National Privacy Principles (as defined in the Privacy Act\n1988); or\n\n(b) other provisions of that Act relating to those Principles; or\n\n(c) an approved privacy code (as defined in that Act) that binds\none or more participants in the section of the\ntelecommunications industry to which the request relates; or\n\n(d) provisions of that Act that relate to the approved privacy\ncode.",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-private-sector-act-2000-sch-2-sec-9-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-private-sector-act-2000-sch-2-sec-9-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "f9dbdeb3945c7b5d9edaddf5768afb2f7b4a708ed98be744ad34ee4dadfd1198",
      "skos:note": "The ACA must consult the Privacy Commissioner before making a request for the development of an industry code."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/privacy-amendment-private-sector-act-2000#sch-2-sec-9",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "9 After subsection 118(4)",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 90,
      "values:originalText": "Insert:\n\n(4A) The ACA must consult the Privacy Commissioner before making a\nrequest under subsection (1) for the development of an industry\ncode that could reasonably be expected to deal directly or\nindirectly with a matter dealt with by:\n\n(a) the National Privacy Principles (as defined in the Privacy Act\n1988); or\n\n(b) other provisions of that Act relating to those Principles; or\n\n(c) an approved privacy code (as defined in that Act) that binds\none or more participants in the section of the\ntelecommunications industry to which the request relates; or\n\n(d) provisions of that Act that relate to the approved privacy\ncode."
    },
