      "values:originalText": "Add “However, this does not prevent the ACA from removing under\nsection 122A an industry code, or a provision of an industry code, from\nthe Register of industry codes kept under this Part.”.",
      "skos:definition": "Add “However, this does not prevent the ACA from removing under\nsection 122A an industry code, or a provision of an industry code, from\nthe Register of industry codes kept under this Part.”.",
