      },
      "dc:source": "privacy-amendment-private-sector-act-2000.pdf, p.90",
      "values:originalText": "Add:\n\n(3) If the ACA is satisfied that the contravention of the industry code\nrelates directly or indirectly to a matter dealt with by the National\nPrivacy Principles (as defined in the Privacy Act 1988) or by an\napproved privacy code (as defined in that Act), the ACA must\nconsult the Privacy Commissioner before issuing the warning.",
      "skos:definition": "Add:\n\n(3) If the ACA is satisfied that the contravention of the industry code\nrelates directly or indirectly to a matter dealt with by the National\nPrivacy Principles (as defined in the Privacy Act 1988) or by an\napproved privacy code (as defined in that Act), the ACA must\nconsult the Privacy Commissioner before issuing the warning.",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-private-sector-act-2000-sch-2-sec-12-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:privacy-amendment-private-sector-act-2000-sch-2-sec-12-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "3feedf9040ba4d7bccbff1fea7cfc71494485452fb8a0a80931b01109d45b835",
      "skos:note": "Consult Privacy Commissioner before issuing warning if contravention relates to National Privacy Principles or approved privacy code."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/privacy-amendment-private-sector-act-2000#sch-2-sec-12",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "12 At the end of section 122",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 90,
      "values:originalText": "Add:\n\n(3) If the ACA is satisfied that the contravention of the industry code\nrelates directly or indirectly to a matter dealt with by the National\nPrivacy Principles (as defined in the Privacy Act 1988) or by an\napproved privacy code (as defined in that Act), the ACA must\nconsult the Privacy Commissioner before issuing the warning."
    },
