      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 91,
      "values:originalText": "Insert:\n\nSchedule 2  Amendment of other Acts\n\n(1A) Paragraph (1)(a) does not require the ACA to continue to include\nin the Register an industry code, or a provision of an industry code,\nremoved from the Register under section 122A."
