    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/privacy-amendment-private-sector-act-2000#sch-2-sec-303b-ss-2",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "303B(2) Acts taken to be authorised by law for purposes of Privacy Act",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 92,
      "values:originalText": "(2) If a disclosure or use of information by a person would be\nprohibited by a provision of Division 4 apart from the fact that the\ndisclosure or use is covered by an exception in that provision to the\nprohibition, the disclosure or use is taken for the purposes of the\nPrivacy Act 1988, and of an approved privacy code (as defined in\nthat Act), to be authorised by law."
    },
