      "values:originalText": "Insert:\n\n(ia) National Privacy Principle 2 (as defined in the Privacy\nAct 1988);\n\n(ib) each approved privacy code (as defined in the Privacy\nAct 1988), if any, that binds a participant in a section of\nthe telecommunications industry;\n\nSchedule 3  Disclosures to intelligence bodies"
    },
